comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T18:02:03.618Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for the exact package/version and inspected the dependency lineage; no canonical item for the 4.1.1 patch existed. This chore reuses the established TOON codec and dependency-governance graph."
  "2026-08-06T18:02:58.516Z","harness:codex","Implementation: advanced @toon-format/toon from 4.1.0 to the latest compatible 4.1.1 patch. The package remains within the existing semver and supported-runtime policy; package and lockfile are linked for traceability."
  "2026-08-06T20:12:28.329Z","harness:codex","Final verification: exact coverage passed across 441 files and 6,902 tests at 100% statements (49461/49461), branches (35933/35933), functions (10115/10115), and lines (47921/47921). TypeScript, ESLint, duplicate detection, 100% docstrings, contracts, SDK surface, package boundaries, SDK parity, token/context/tracker gates, zero-vulnerability audits, and temporary packed npx/direct-SDK/bunx acceptance passed. Timing budgets passed in a clean isolated sample; later host-load samples were invalidated by unrelated system contention without changing budgets."
  "2026-08-06T20:35:41.355Z","harness:codex","Review round 1: CodeRabbit produced 11 actionable exact-head findings spanning concurrency-safe audited writes, storage validation, finite numeric contracts, bounded history efficiency, invalid timestamp handling, CLI/schema recovery text, public changelog content, PM changelog linkage, and portable tests. Reopened and claimed only these four canonical items while addressing their own PR feedback."
  "2026-08-06T20:58:33.022Z","harness:codex","Review remediation verified: CHANGELOG.md is now linked as generated release documentation on every active item; the provenance entry title describes delivered public behavior. pm-changelog 2026.8.6 regenerated and checked the file without repo-local generator patches."
  "2026-08-06T20:58:38.019Z","harness:codex","Post-review exact verification: 441 files and 6,903 tests passed at 100% statements (49476/49476), branches (35951/35951), functions (10122/10122), and lines (47936/47936). TypeScript, ESLint, zero-clone JSCPD, 100% docstrings, package boundaries, SDK parity, contracts, token/context/tracker/gate registries, docs, secrets, and zero-vulnerability production audit pass. Import timing is separately limited by current host load and no budget was changed."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T20:12:07.308Z","harness:codex","A compatible codec patch still warrants transport acceptance across packed npm, npx, direct SDK import, Bun, and bunx because serialization sits beneath every tracker contract."
